# A bitten jelly bun at the bakery (The Missing Cat). Format: dialogue/dialogue_parser.gd
@when cat_clue_3 -> again

== offer ==
This jelly was bitten off, and a few orange hairs stuck in it. [set cat_clue_3]
Marta's going to be [shake]furious[/shake].

== again ==
Only Marta, from the Bakery make these, I should go there sometimes. However, that damn [color=#d9772b]cat[/color] must be near.
